WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
I am back in the UK and I have a cold.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.700
I've lost my voice, I sound a little bit like Tom Waits.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.880
So, it is the 21st century:

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.620
Why can I not just take a pill and cure this thing?

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:14.280
Well, first of all the pills we do have are antibiotics

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.220
and they don't work against colds.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.980
You'll have seen this poster in your doctor's office.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.280
You need a vaccination.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:25.180
And well, it's difficult to find a vaccination for the common cold,

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.420
for the same reason that once you've have one cold

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.560
your body is not automatically immune against all others.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.080
There are hundreds of the buggers

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.080
and they keep mutating.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.860
It's the same reason why you have to have a flu shot every year.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.740
Actually that's worse than that,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.740
the World Health Organization has to predict,

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:43.740
months in advance,

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.380
which flu strains will be 'popular'

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.440
this winter.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.380
And then ramp up vaccine production accordingly.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:53.100
And they've got natural selection against them too:

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.100
If they release that vaccine too early,

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.800
then the viruses that are able to
rapidly mutate against it

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.080
will be successful and will spread instead.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.440
The common cold works in a similar way:

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:06.480
There are hundreds of strains constantly mutating.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.120
And because it doesn't generally kill people, just causes some discomfort,

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:14.280
there isn't the millions and millions and millions in research funds

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:17.000
going towards getting rid of it.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.960
So instead we take pain killers,

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.960
and anti-inflammatories

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.200
and decongestants,

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.640
and we accept that we can win this battle

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.740
on our own.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.820
Even though we cannot win the war.

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.980
Because the enemy will go away,

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.060
mutate,

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:36.320
and just come back a few months later.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.280
And that is something you may not have known.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.200
And now I am going to stop talking.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.320
Closed captions by MM.
